      "japanese": "田中さんは娘を大学へ行かせた",
      "body_text": "田中さんは娘を大学へ行かせた \n\n\t\tTanaka san \n\t\t \n\t\tmade/let his daughter go to college",
      "body_html": "<a href=\"http://www.csse.monash.edu.au/~jwb/cgi-bin/wwwjdic.cgi?9MHJ田中さんは娘を大学へ行かせた\">\n\t\t\t\t田中さんは娘を大学へ<strong>行かせた</strong><strong></strong></a> <br/>\n\t\tTanaka san \n\t\t<strong> </strong>\n\t\tmade/let his daughter go to college",
